// ADR 0111 §7: how long an entry stays pending, retried or unsettled,
// before a receive claims it again. It must exceed what one element may
// take, its workflow's timeout and its settle (§5a), or another consumer
// would take an element still being handled; 5 minutes leaves room for
// the default 30 s request timeout and a batch of several.
wire RedisStreamSettings {
    retryAfterMillis: int from env "REDIS_STREAM_RETRY_AFTER_MS" = 300000;
}
